      "source_text": "高祖本纪",
      "crossdoc_enabled_by_design": true
    }
  },
  {
    "number": "94d18bb5-29cc-51b5-b0c3-70afe2b6f85b.8.10.10",
    "sentence": "这时刘季再三谦让，大家都不敢担任，最后还是立刘季为沛公。",
    "characters": {
      "刘邦": true,
      "萧何": false
